  "_doc": "Candy Kingdom frosting decorations (bead bzc.115, docs/art/classes/decorations.md): passable small details at 32 x 32 with the doodad class layer, impassable props on 64 x 64 (one cell) or 128 x 64 (two cells side by side) with the prop class layer. generate-image-v2, no style image, like set decorations; one call returns many candidates of a mixed subject, the best distinct ones are accepted and cropped to their opaque box plus 1 px. Recipes are never edited after generation: add a new id (new seed) instead.",
