      "subject": "Subject: one tiny candy-land detail, each image a different one of these: two round sugar-crusted gumdrops, one pink #f08cb8 and one mint #8fdcc0; a small red and white striped candy cane #e03a3e #fff4ec stuck upright in the ground; a dropped ice-cream cone upside down, its pink scoop melting into a little puddle; a green gummy worm #8fd06a with an orange stripe, curled; a tiny white sugar mouse #fff4ec with a pink nose and a string tail; a little scatter of a few short rainbow sprinkles. Small and low, about half of the image wide, much smaller than a person.",
      "negative": "ground patch, shadow, person, face on the candy, gold, coins, gem, chest, wrapper, plate"
